    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORLD RALLY ARCADE</strong> is my <i>first ever game that I've released</i>, and was a summer project for 2024 to see if I could be able to make and release a game on Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a simple single-player, race to the line game. Race across the varied scenery of the <i><strong>European forest</strong></i>, a <i><strong>huge stadium</strong></i>, and the <i><strong>African savannah</strong></i> as you try to set the fastest time you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>You</strong></i> versus the <i>clock...</i> who will come out on <i><strong>top</strong></i>?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORLD RALLY ARCADE</strong> is my <i>first ever game that I've released</i>, and was a summer project for 2024 to see if I could be able to make and release a game on Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a simple single-player, race to the line game. Race across the varied scenery of the <i><strong>European forest</strong></i>, a <i><strong>huge stadium</strong></i>, and the <i><strong>African savannah</strong></i> as you try to set the fastest time you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>You</strong></i> versus the <i>clock...</i> who will come out on <i><strong>top</strong></i>?</p>",
